</section>
<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="card shadow-sm p-4" style="border-radius: 12px;">
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">How to Add a Watermark to Your PDF</h2>

          <p>
        Adding a watermark to your PDF is a simple way to protect your content, mark drafts, or brand your documents professionally. Our <strong>PDF watermark tool online</strong> allows you to add custom text watermarks to one or multiple pages of your PDF quickly and securely. The process works entirely in your browser, requires no software installation, and is completely free.
    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Introduction</h2>

    <p>
        PDFs are commonly used for sharing official documents, reports, eBooks, and presentations. However, when sharing sensitive or original content, there is always a risk of unauthorized copying or distribution. Adding a watermark ensures that your content is clearly labeled, branded, or protected without altering the original information.
    </p>

    <p>
        Our online PDF watermark tool enables users to insert customized text watermarks across all pages or specific pages of a PDF. This method enhances document security, maintains professional appearance, and works on Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS devices directly in your browser.
    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Step-by-Step Guide to Add a Watermark to PDF</h2>

    <p>
        Adding a watermark to your PDF online is simple and intuitive. Follow these steps:
    </p>

    <ol class="mb-4">
        <li>
            <strong>Upload your PDF file:</strong> Drag and drop your PDF into the upload area or select it from your device.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Enter the watermark text:</strong> Type the text you want to appear on your PDF pages. This could be “DRAFT,” “CONFIDENTIAL,” or a brand name.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Click “Add Watermark”:</strong> The tool applies the watermark across all selected pages instantly.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Download your watermarked PDF:</strong> Once processing is complete, download your PDF with the watermark applied.
        </li>
    </ol>

    <p>
        The process is fully online, safe, and requires no technical expertise, making it ideal for professionals, students, and casual users alike.
    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Benefits of Using Our PDF Watermark Tool</h2>

    <p>
        Using our online watermark tool provides multiple advantages:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Free and easy to use:</strong> Add watermarks without paying or registering an account.</li>
        <li><strong>Protect sensitive content:</strong> Mark your PDFs as drafts, confidential, or proprietary.</li>
        <li><strong>Brand your documents:</strong> Use your company name, logo, or unique text for branding purposes.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast and reliable:</strong> Apply watermarks to one or multiple pages instantly.</li>
        <li><strong>Cross-platform support:</strong> Works on Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS directly in your browser.</li>
        <li><strong>No software installation required:</strong> Complete the process entirely online.</li>
        <li><strong>Secure and private:</strong> Files are encrypted during upload and deleted after processing.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-3">
