    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Use Cases for PDF Watermarks</h2>

    <p>
        Our PDF watermark tool is versatile and suitable for a wide variety of scenarios:
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">1. Protect Confidential Documents</h4>
    <p>
        Mark reports, contracts, or sensitive files as “CONFIDENTIAL” to prevent unauthorized sharing or copying.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">2. Draft Versions of Reports</h4>
    <p>
        Use the watermark “DRAFT” on incomplete reports or presentations to indicate that the document is a work in progress.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">3. Branding Business Documents</h4>
    <p>
        Add your company name or slogan as a watermark to invoices, proposals, or marketing materials to reinforce branding and professionalism.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">4. Academic Work</h4>
    <p>
