    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">5. eBooks and Digital Publications</h4>
    <p>
        Authors can add watermarks to eBooks or digital publications to protect their content from unauthorized distribution.
    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Why Choose Our Online PDF Watermark Tool?</h2>

    <p>
        While there are many watermark tools available, our solution stands out for its simplicity, speed, and security:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Intuitive interface:</strong> Add watermarks in just a few clicks, with no learning curve.</li>
        <li><strong>Quick processing:</strong> Apply watermarks to multiple pages instantly.</li>
        <li><strong>Full browser compatibility:</strong> Works on all modern browsers and devices.</li>
        <li><strong>Customizable text:</strong> Choose any text for your watermark, making it suitable for branding, protection, or labeling.</li>
        <li><strong>Secure and private:</strong> All files are processed over secure HTTPS connections and deleted after completion.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        Our tool is continuously updated to ensure smooth performance across devices and all PDF standards.
    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">FAQ: Frequently Asked Questions About PDF Watermarks</h2>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q1: Is this PDF watermark tool free?</h4>
    <p>
        Yes, our online PDF watermark tool is completely free. You can add watermarks to PDFs without paying or subscribing.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q2: Do I need an account?</h4>
    <p>
        No registration is required. Simply upload your PDF, add the watermark, and download your document instantly.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q3: Can I use this tool on mobile devices?</h4>
    <p>
        Yes, the tool is fully responsive and works on Android and iOS devices directly in your browser.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q4: Can I watermark all pages of a PDF?</h4>
    <p>
        Yes, the tool can apply your watermark to all pages automatically or you can choose specific pages.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q5: Will adding a watermark affect the PDF quality?</h4>
    <p>
        No, your PDF’s quality, layout, and formatting remain intact. Only the watermark is added on top of your existing content.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q6: Can I customize the watermark text?</h4>
    <p>
        Yes, you can add any text you want as a watermark, including “DRAFT,” “CONFIDENTIAL,” your name, or company branding.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q7: Are my files secure during processing?</h4>
    <p>
        Absolutely. Files are encrypted during upload and deleted from our servers immediately after processing to protect your privacy.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q8: Can I remove the watermark after adding it?</h4>
    <p>
        Once the watermark is applied and the PDF is downloaded, it becomes part of the document. Keep a backup of your original file if you may need an unmarked version later.
    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Conclusion</h2>

    <p>
        Adding watermarks to PDFs has never been easier. Our free online PDF watermark tool allows you to protect, label, and brand your documents securely and efficiently. Whether for business, academic, or personal use, the tool ensures your PDFs are professional and secure.
    </p>

    <p>
        Fully compatible across devices and browsers, this tool allows you to add custom text watermarks to any PDF instantly. Start protecting your documents today by uploading your PDF, entering your watermark text, clicking “Add Watermark,” and downloading your updated file.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-3">
